From 5127a653fe163083f9c62933ed40cfa0d8c56615 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 14:41:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(zai): add Coding Plan models to allowlist + diagnostic
 endpoint
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

ROOT CAUSE (finally identified):
The user's Z.ai API key is from the GLM Coding Plan, which only
includes glm-4-coding and glm-4v-coding — NOT glm-4-flash. The
strict allowlist (commit a11a636) only accepted glm-4-flash, so
even when the user set ZAI_PROPOSAL_MODEL=glm-4-coding in Vercel,
the guard rejected it and forced glm-4-flash — which the Coding
Plan key can't access, producing HTTP 400 code 1211 'Unknown Model'.

FIX 1 — lib/ai-provider-registry.ts:
Expand ZAI_VALID_MODEL_CODES allowlist to include all known Z.ai
model codes across all plan types:
  General API: glm-4-flash, glm-4-flashx, glm-4-air, glm-4-airx,
    glm-4-plus, glm-4-long, glm-4-0520, glm-4v, glm-4v-flash
  Coding Plan: glm-4-coding, glm-4v-coding

FIX 2 — app/api/admin/ai-provider-health/zai-diagnostic/route.ts:
New admin-only diagnostic endpoint that:
  - Shows masked API key + ZAI_BASE_URL + ZAI_*_MODEL env values
  - Detects wrong key types (OpenAI/Google/Groq keys in ZAI_API_KEY)
  - Tests 5 model names against the live Z.ai API
  - Identifies root cause: wrong key, wrong endpoint, Coding Plan
    key on international endpoint, expired key, etc.
  - Gives specific recommendation for each root cause

FIX 3 — tests/zai-model-regression.test.ts:
Updated to require glm-4-coding + glm-4v-coding in the allowlist.

USAGE for Coding Plan users:
  Set in Vercel env vars:
    ZAI_BASE_URL=https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4
    ZAI_PROPOSAL_MODEL=glm-4-coding
    ZAI_ANALYSIS_MODEL=glm-4-coding
    ZAI_FAST_MODEL=glm-4-coding

USAGE for General API users:
  Leave ZAI_*_MODEL unset (code default glm-4-flash is correct)
  Leave ZAI_BASE_URL unset (default api.z.ai is correct)
